---
// input: Reported ascension requirements, rewards, and planning cautions from site research
// output: Sell Lemons ascension guide page with requirements, rewards, and Forever Purchase advice
// pos: /Users/tangjei/Documents/建站/游戏站/selllemonswiki/src/pages/ascension.astro (更新规则：文件变更需同步本注释与所属目录 README)
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import RelatedGuides from "../components/RelatedGuides.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Sell Lemons Ascension Guide | Requirements and Rewards" description="Plan Sell Lemons ascension with reported requirements, rewards, Forever Purchase timing, and reset preparation for Roblox progression.">
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero guide-detail-hero">
      <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Endgame Reset</p>
          <h1>Sell Lemons Ascension Guide</h1>
          <p>Ascension is a late-game reset layer. Use this page to check the reported readiness signals, understand the reward tradeoff, and avoid using Forever Purchase on a weak button.</p>
        </div>
        <img src="/sell_lemons_hero_main.png" alt="Sell Lemons ascension requirements and rewards" width="894" height="500" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="guide-detail">
      <p class="evidence-note">Evidence boundary: ascension values are community-reported unless confirmed in-game. Keep screenshots or direct checks before treating numbers as verified.</p>

      <h2>Ascension Readiness</h2>
      <div class="guide-step-flow">
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Complete the stairway path</h3>
          <p>Players report that stairway completion is a major gate before ascension. If the option does not appear, inspect unfinished buttons and hidden decoration gates first.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Clear required tycoon buttons</h3>
          <p>Ascension planning is not only wallet cash. The game can depend on total build completion, optional blockers, and late-stage progression nodes.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="guide-step-card">
          <h3>Plan the first Forever Purchase</h3>
          <p>Choose a button that compounds through future resets. A global cash or speed upgrade is usually easier to justify than a slow late-game source.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <h2>Reward Tradeoff</h2>
      <div class="mini-table">
        <span>Reported reward: global cash multiplier</span>
        <span>Reported reward: one Forever Purchase token</span>
        <span>Reported cost: higher future purchase prices</span>
        <span>Planning risk: weak permanent unlock choice</span>
      </div>

      <section class="guide-what-next" aria-labelledby="ascension-next">
        <header class="guide-what-next__head">
          <h2 id="ascension-next">What to Do Next</h2>
        </header>
        <a class="guide-what-next__cta" href="/evolution/">
          <span class="guide-what-next__cta-copy">
            <strong>Review Evolution Timing</strong>
            <span>Check whether your evolution loop is ready before forcing an ascension push.</span>
          </span>
          <span class="guide-what-next__cta-chevron" aria-hidden="true">&gt;</span>
        </a>
      </section>

      <RelatedGuides currentSlug="ascension" />
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
